{
  "id": "2CO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Ndị Kọrint 6",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Open Igbo Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1980, 1988, 2019, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dịka ndị ha na ya na-arụkọ ọrụ nʼotu, anyị na-arịọ arịrịọ sị unu ahapụla ịnara amara a Chineke na-enye unu nʼefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na ọ na-ekwu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Nʼoge m na-anara mmadụ nke ọma anụrụ m olu unu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụkwa ụbọchị nzọpụta ka m nyeere unu aka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lee, ugbu a bụ oge a na-anabata mmadụ nke ọma, ugbu a bụ ụbọchị nzọpụta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahụhụ Pọl hụrụ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị etinyeghị ihe ịsọ ngọngọ nʼụzọ onye ọbụla ka ọ ghara iwetara ọrụ anyị ihe ịta ụta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama nʼime ihe niile, anyị na-agbalịsị ike ime ka ndị mmadụ mara na anyị bụ ndị na-ejere Chineke ozi. Anyị ji ndidi na ntachiobi na-edi nsogbu niile na mkpagbu niile na ahụhụ niile na-adakwasị anyị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A na-eti anyị ihe otiti ọtụtụ mgbe. E tinyekwala anyị nʼime ụlọ mkpọrọ dị iche iche. Ọtụtụ mgbe ka igwe mmadụ tikwara anyị ihe otiti. Anyị na-adọgbu onwe anyị nʼọrụ. Ọtụtụ abalị anyị nọkwara nʼime ịmụ anya na-erighị nri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼime ịdị ọcha na ezi nghọta na ntachiobi nke anyị nwere, nʼinwe obiọma na ezi ịhụnanya nke ihu abụọ nʼadịghị na ya nʼime Mmụọ Nsọ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sitekwa nʼikwu eziokwu na site nʼike Chineke. Anyị buru ezi omume dịka ngwa agha nʼaka nri na nʼaka ekpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ụfọdụ na-asọpụrụ anyị ma ndị ọzọ na-eme anyị ihe ihere. Ụfọdụ na-ata anyị ụta, ma ụfọdụ na-eto anyị. Ụfọdụ mmadụ na-agụ anyị dị ka ndị ụgha, ma anyị nọgidesịrị ike na-ekwu eziokwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ụwa amaghị anyị, ma a maara anyị. Ọ bụ ezie na anyị na ọnwụ na-anọ nso mgbe niile, ma lee anyị ka dịkwa ndụ. A na-ata anyị ahụhụ, ma lee anyị anwụghị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị na-anọ nʼihe mwute mgbe niile, ma lee ọṅụ juru anyị obi. Anyị bụ ndị ogbenye, ma anyị na-eme ka ọtụtụ mmadụ bụrụ ndị ọgaranya. Anyị enweghị ihe ọbụla, ma lee anyị nwere ihe niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị enyi anyị nọ na Kọrint, anyị agwala unu ihe niile dị anyị nʼobi, anyị emeghepụla obi anyị nye unu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị ji obi anyị niile hụ unu nʼanya, ma unu mechiri obi unu nʼebe anyị nọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugbu a, ana m ekwu dịka ana m agwa ụmụntakịrị. Na-emesonu anyị dịka anyị si emeso unu, meenụ ka obi unu saa mbara nʼebe anyị nọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndị Kraịst na ndị na-ekweghị ekwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu ekwela ka unu na ndị na-ekweghị ekwe nwee nkekọta ọbụla. Nʼihi na gịnị ka ezi omume na ajọ omume nwekọrọ? Olee ụdị mmekọ ìhè na ọchịchịrị ga-enwekọ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụ nwekọ dị aṅaa dị na-agbata Kraịst na ekwensu? Gịnịkwa ka onye kwere ekwe na onye na-ekweghị ekwe nwekọrọ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gịnị bụ ihe jikọtara ụlọnsọ Chineke na arụsị? Nʼihi na anyị onwe anyị bụ ụlọnsọ Chineke dị ndụ. Dịka Chineke kwuru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"M ga-ebi nʼime ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jegharịakwa nʼime ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "M ga-abụkwa Chineke ha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ma ha onwe ha ga-abụkwa ndị nke m.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Sinụ nʼetiti ha pụta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nọpụkwanụ iche nʼebe ha nọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Otu a ka Onyenwe anyị kwuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Unu emetụkwala ihe ọbụla rụrụ arụ aka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mụ onwe m ga-akpọbatakwa unu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Aga m abụrụ unu Nna,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "unu onwe unu ga-abụkwara m ụmụ m ndị ikom na ndị inyom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Otu a ka Onyenwe anyị, Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
